DEFAULT MODEL
-------------
The default NER model loaded by this package is "maskera-sv-ner"
(joelhagvall/maskera-sv-ner), maskera's own Swedish model. Its weights are
MIT-licensed. It is a derivative of KB-BERT (KBLab/bert-base-swedish-cased),
released CC0-1.0 (public domain) by the National Library of Sweden
(Kungliga biblioteket), acknowledged gratefully.

  Model:   https://huggingface.co/joelhagvall/maskera-sv-ner
  Base:    https://huggingface.co/KBLab/bert-base-swedish-cased
  Revision: ce7c3424687f042f1320e0528293d492c82918c4

Note: this package does not bundle any weights; they are downloaded at
runtime from the Hugging Face Hub (or served from your own origin via
`localModelPath`). If you load a third-party model instead, its own license
terms apply.
